00:18:19,441 --> 00:18:23,421
I've got it sitting there, but it's not connected, yeah, on this one.

213
00:18:23,421 --> 00:18:27,981
So, why a bipolar transistor, why couldn't it be done like this instead?

214
00:18:28,541 --> 00:18:29,201
Don't do it that way.

215
00:18:29,521 --> 00:18:37,521
The thing is that this diode right here, and the transistor's own diode, they interfere with how this coil operates.

216
00:18:37,641 --> 00:18:41,141
There's a reverse current, and it damps this ringing.

217
00:18:41,541 --> 00:18:46,861
You need the transistor to be such that it shuts off completely, as if there's nothing at all on this coil.

218
00:18:47,861 --> 00:18:49,201
That's the most important point right there.

